confconsole (2.2.3+keel13) trixie; urgency=low

  * The first boot role screen does not run keel inspect on a machine
    with no database server. keel inspect reads the whole machine to find
    the engine: 2 s on a Web container, 8 s with a quarter of a CPU, with
    the password screen still up and nothing new on it (the maintainer's
    Proxmox console after <Saved>, 2026-10-02). Without any server binary
    of keel's own table (keel.inspect.dbengines.ENGINES) there is nothing
    to find, so the role stays standalone at once, and the journal says
    why as before. When the table cannot be read, keel is asked.

