confconsole (2.2.3+keel10) trixie; urgency=low

  * Every screen names Keel Linux. The backtitle read "TurnKey GNU/Linux
    Configuration Console" and, without /etc/appname, the menus were
    titled "TurnKey Linux <HOSTNAME>"; they read "Keel Linux
    Configuration Console" and "Keel Linux <HOSTNAME>" (BRAND, TITLE).
