    the sign up link is Brevo's own page instead of TurnKey's referral
    link through the TurnKey Hub, and the SendinBlue entry is Brevo's
    relay, not TurnKey's preferred gateway. Its key is now Brevo, the
    name the code after the menu already tested for: with the old key
    the Brevo host and port were never filled in.
  * Let's Encrypt and the security update settings point at this
    repository's documentation (docs/Lets_encrypt.rst,
    docs/System_settings.rst) instead of turnkeylinux.org, and a missing
    DNS provider list is reported to the confconsole issues here, not to
    TurnKey.
