    commands (installed names, run by the screens), the Python class
    name TurnkeyConsole, the package dependencies on turnkey-netinfo and
    turnkey-conffile, and the copyright notices. The docs/ and README
    still describe TurnKey; they are not shown on an appliance.
  * tests/test_brand.py checks the backtitle, the appname and that no
    string of a shipped screen names TurnKey or TKLBAM.

